# GitLab registry credentials for scripts/app.sh (copy to scripts/gitlab-deploy.env,
# which is gitignored). Two supported setups:
#
# A) Personal access token (what we have): the TOKEN is auto-sourced by app.sh from
#    ~/projects/vrt/.conf/gitlab-admin-token.conf, so you set ONLY the username here —
#    for a PAT the registry login username is the token owner's GitLab username.
GITLAB_DEPLOY_USER=your-gitlab-username
#
# B) A dedicated deploy token (scopes: write_registry + read_registry) — then set both:
# GITLAB_DEPLOY_USER=gitlab+deploy-token-N
# GITLAB_DEPLOY_TOKEN=glpat-or-deploy-token-secret
